    "body": "Every script has a [base URL](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-script-base-url) which is the URL it was fetched from, for external scripts, or the URL of the page it was embedded in, for inline scripts. It's called the base URL since it's used to resolve relative imports.",
